    "Coverage remains open for DentonCentralAppraisalDistrict elected places1\u20133, TheColony single-member districts3\u20136 and any other city/school/special fields absent from the acquired primary inventory. TheColony current election page links an August10filinglist for9applicants; it predates filing close and proves no final November qualification. No ordinary candidate is installed from that old list.",
    "District/precinct electorates are exact. Regionalcourt2, six held judicial districts, commissioner precincts2/4, justice precincts1\u20136, constable precinct1 and CityofDenton council district1 require reader geography matching; no entire county/city is substituted for a subdistrict. Data-ready candidate facts do not establish reader visibility.",
    "Declaredwriteins are separate from printed ordinary candidates. The current statewide/district certification contains no entry for either Second Appeals seat or the six Denton judicial districts; county/municipal/special named write-in inventories remain pending. No generic blank Write-in is treated as a person.",
    "The official SecondCourt county list supports12whole-county districtMemberships, one each for Archer,Clay,Cooke,Denton,Hood,Jack,Montague,Parker,Tarrant,Wichita,Wise,Young. The same two regional offices can therefore serve every included county; no per-county duplicate contest is minted. Actual reader delivery remains for parent/River to verify."
